# with PayHere directly, as a fallback for local dev where notify_url
# (localhost) can never be reached by PayHere's servers. Get these from the
# PayHere sandbox merchant portal: Settings > Domains & Credentials > Add
# Domain, then create an App for that domain (App ID + App Secret).
# Without these, everything still works as before via notify_url alone.
